{"id": "syn-oov-005", "text": "昨日友達とデュオってたら気づいたら朝だった。", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-005", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "surface": "昨日", "kind": "word", "entries": [1579260], "form": "昨日", "reading": "きのう", "form_reading": "きのう", "targets": ["long-compound"]}, {"start": 2, "end": 4, "surface": "友達", "kind": "word", "entries": [1540170], "form": "友達", "reading": "ともだち", "form_reading": "ともだち", "targets": ["long-compound"]}, {"start": 4, "end": 5, "surface": "と", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 5, "end": 12, "surface": "デュオってたら", "kind": "word", "form": "デュオる", "reading": "でゅおってたら", "form_reading": "でゅおる", "chain": ["-て", "-いる", "-たら"], "split_points": [8], "targets": ["oov", "katakana", "inflection-chain", "te-auxiliary", "contraction"]}, {"start": 12, "end": 17, "surface": "気づいたら", "kind": "word", "entries": [1591330], "form": "気づく", "reading": "きづいたら", "form_reading": "きづく", "chain": ["-たら"], "split_points": [13], "targets": ["compound"]}, {"start": 17, "end": 18, "surface": "朝", "kind": "word", "entries": [1428280], "form": "朝", "reading": "あさ", "form_reading": "あさ"}, {"start": 18, "end": 21, "surface": "だった", "kind": "copula"}], "label": {"status": "adjudicated", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-006", "text": "削ったのは俺なのにラスヒだけ持ってかれた〜", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-006", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "surface": "削った", "kind": "word", "entries": [1298090], "form": "削る", "reading": "けずった", "form_reading": "けずる", "chain": ["-た"]}, {"start": 3, "end": 4, "surface": "の", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 4, "end": 5, "surface": "は", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 5, "end": 6, "surface": "俺", "kind": "word", "entries": [1576870], "form": "俺", "reading": "おれ", "form_reading": "おれ"}, {"start": 6, "end": 7, "surface": "な", "kind": "copula"}, {"start": 7, "end": 9, "surface": "のに", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 9, "end": 12, "surface": "ラスヒ", "kind": "word", "form": "ラスヒ", "reading": "らすひ", "form_reading": "らすひ", "targets": ["oov", "katakana"]}, {"start": 12, "end": 14, "surface": "だけ", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 14, "end": 21, "surface": "持ってかれた〜", "kind": "word", "entries": [1315720], "form": "持つ", "reading": "もってかれた〜", "form_reading": "もつ", "chain": ["-て", "-いく", "passive", "-た"], "targets": ["inflection-chain", "te-auxiliary", "contraction", "elongation"]}], "label": {"status": "adjudicated", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-007", "text": "たまに野良ってみると知らない人と仲良くなれる。", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-007", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "surface": "たまに", "kind": "word", "entries": [1634500], "form": "たまに", "reading": "たまに", "form_reading": "たまに"}, {"start": 3, "end": 9, "surface": "野良ってみる", "kind": "word", "form": "野良る", "reading": "のらってみる", "form_reading": "のらる", "chain": ["-て", "-みる"], "split_points": [5], "targets": ["oov", "inflection-chain", "te-auxiliary"]}, {"start": 9, "end": 10, "surface": "と", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 10, "end": 14, "surface": "知らない", "kind": "word", "entries": [1420470], "form": "知る", "reading": "しらない", "form_reading": "しる", "chain": ["negative"]}, {"start": 14, "end": 15, "surface": "人", "kind": "word", "entries": [1580640], "form": "人", "reading": "ひと", "form_reading": "ひと", "targets": ["heteronym"]}, {"start": 15, "end": 16, "surface": "と", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 16, "end": 19, "surface": "仲良く", "kind": "word", "entries": [2827365], "form": "仲良い", "reading": "なかよく", "form_reading": "なかよい", "chain": ["-く"], "split_points": [17], "targets": ["compound"]}, {"start": 19, "end": 22, "surface": "なれる", "kind": "word", "entries": [1375610], "form": "なる", "reading": "なれる", "form_reading": "なる", "chain": ["potential"], "targets": ["potential-ranuki"]}], "label": {"status": "adjudicated", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-008", "text": "給料日だし、限定キャラ出るまでガチャるか。", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-008", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "surface": "給料日", "kind": "word", "entries": [1230370], "form": "給料日", "reading": "きゅうりょうび", "form_reading": "きゅうりょうび", "split_points": [2], "targets": ["compound"]}, {"start": 3, "end": 4, "surface": "だ", "kind": "copula"}, {"start": 4, "end": 5, "surface": "し", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 6, "end": 8, "surface": "限定", "kind": "word", "entries": [1264670], "form": "限定", "reading": "げんてい", "form_reading": "げんてい"}, {"start": 8, "end": 11, "surface": "キャラ", "kind": "word", "entries": [1923480], "form": "キャラ", "reading": "きゃら", "form_reading": "きゃら", "targets": ["katakana"]}, {"start": 11, "end": 13, "surface": "出る", "kind": "word", "entries": [1338240], "form": "出る", "reading": "でる", "form_reading": "でる"}, {"start": 13, "end": 15, "surface": "まで", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 15, "end": 19, "surface": "ガチャる", "kind": "word", "form": "ガチャる", "reading": "がちゃる", "form_reading": "がちゃる", "split_points": [18], "targets": ["oov", "katakana"]}, {"start": 19, "end": 20, "surface": "か", "kind": "particle"}], "label": {"status": "adjudicated", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-009", "text": "今日エイムがガバいのは寝不足のせいってことで。", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-009", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "surface": "今日", "kind": "word", "entries": [1579110], "form": "今日", "reading": "きょう", "form_reading": "きょう", "targets": ["heteronym"]}, {"start": 2, "end": 5, "surface": "エイム", "kind": "word", "entries": [2839106], "form": "エイム", "reading": "えいむ", "form_reading": "えいむ", "targets": ["katakana"]}, {"start": 5, "end": 6, "surface": "が", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 6, "end": 9, "surface": "ガバい", "kind": "word", "form": "ガバい", "reading": "がばい", "form_reading": "がばい", "targets": ["oov"]}, {"start": 9, "end": 10, "surface": "の", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 10, "end": 11, "surface": "は", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 11, "end": 14, "surface": "寝不足", "kind": "word", "entries": [1360270], "form": "寝不足", "reading": "ねぶそく", "form_reading": "ねぶそく", "split_points": [12], "targets": ["compound"]}, {"start": 14, "end": 15, "surface": "の", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 15, "end": 17, "surface": "せい", "kind": "word", "entries": [1610040], "form": "せい", "reading": "せい", "form_reading": "せい"}, {"start": 17, "end": 19, "surface": "って", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 19, "end": 21, "surface": "こと", "kind": "word", "entries": [1313580], "form": "こと", "reading": "こと", "form_reading": "こと"}, {"start": 21, "end": 22, "surface": "で", "kind": "copula"}], "label": {"status": "audited", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-011", "text": "相手ずっとガン待ちしてて全然攻めてこないんだけど？", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-011", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "surface": "相手", "kind": "word", "entries": [1401000], "form": "相手", "reading": "あいて", "form_reading": "あいて"}, {"start": 2, "end": 5, "surface": "ずっと", "kind": "word", "entries": [1006380], "form": "ずっと", "reading": "ずっと", "form_reading": "ずっと"}, {"start": 5, "end": 7, "surface": "ガン", "kind": "prefix"}, {"start": 7, "end": 9, "surface": "待ち", "kind": "word", "entries": [1640770], "form": "待ち", "reading": "まち", "form_reading": "まち", "targets": ["prefix"]}, {"start": 9, "end": 12, "surface": "してて", "kind": "word", "entries": [1157170], "form": "する", "reading": "してて", "form_reading": "する", "chain": ["-て", "-いる", "-て"], "targets": ["inflection-chain", "te-auxiliary", "contraction"]}, {"start": 12, "end": 14, "surface": "全然", "kind": "word", "entries": [1395620], "form": "全然", "reading": "ぜんぜん", "form_reading": "ぜんぜん"}, {"start": 14, "end": 20, "surface": "攻めてこない", "kind": "word", "entries": [1279130], "form": "攻める", "reading": "せめてこない", "form_reading": "せめる", "chain": ["-て", "-くる", "negative"], "targets": ["inflection-chain", "te-auxiliary"]}, {"start": 20, "end": 22, "surface": "んだ", "kind": "expression", "entries": [2849387], "form": "んだ", "reading": "んだ", "form_reading": "んだ", "split_points": [21], "targets": ["grammar-expression"]}, {"start": 22, "end": 24, "surface": "けど", "kind": "particle"}], "label": {"status": "agreed", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-012", "text": "起き上がりに必殺技ぶっぱする人、多すぎない？", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-012", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "surface": "起き上がり", "kind": "word", "entries": [1223650], "form": "起き上がる", "reading": "おきあがり", "form_reading": "おきあがる", "chain": ["continuative"], "split_points": [2], "targets": ["compound"]}, {"start": 5, "end": 6, "surface": "に", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 6, "end": 9, "surface": "必殺技", "kind": "word", "entries": [2061290], "form": "必殺技", "reading": "ひっさつわざ", "form_reading": "ひっさつわざ", "split_points": [8], "targets": ["compound"]}, {"start": 9, "end": 12, "surface": "ぶっぱ", "kind": "word", "form": "ぶっぱ", "reading": "ぶっぱ", "form_reading": "ぶっぱ", "targets": ["oov"]}, {"start": 12, "end": 14, "surface": "する", "kind": "word", "entries": [1157170], "form": "する", "reading": "する", "form_reading": "する"}, {"start": 14, "end": 15, "surface": "人", "kind": "word", "entries": [1580640], "form": "人", "reading": "ひと", "form_reading": "ひと", "targets": ["heteronym"]}, {"start": 16, "end": 21, "surface": "多すぎない", "kind": "word", "entries": [1407460], "form": "多い", "reading": "おおすぎない", "form_reading": "おおい", "chain": ["-すぎる", "negative"], "targets": ["inflection-chain"]}], "label": {"status": "adjudicated", "spec": "0.5"}}
{"id": "syn-oov-013", "text": "復活した瞬間リスキルされるの理不尽すぎる。", "source": {"corpus": "synthetic", "ref": "oov-013", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "attribution": "monosashi synthetic sentence, written by Claude (Anthropic), 2026-10-15"}, "register": "game-net", "slice": "synthetic", "units": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "surface": "復活した", "kind": "word", "entries": [1500700], "form": "復活", "reading": "ふっかつした", "form_reading": "ふっかつ", "chain": ["-た"], "targets": ["suru-verb"]}, {"start": 4, "end": 6, "surface": "瞬間", "kind": "word", "entries": [1341210], "form": "瞬間", "reading": "しゅんかん", "form_reading": "しゅんかん"}, {"start": 6, "end": 10, "surface": "リスキル", "kind": "word", "form": "リスキル", "reading": "りすきる", "form_reading": "りすきる", "targets": ["oov", "katakana"]}, {"start": 10, "end": 13, "surface": "される", "kind": "word", "entries": [1157170], "form": "する", "reading": "される", "form_reading": "する", "chain": ["passive"]}, {"start": 13, "end": 14, "surface": "の", "kind": "particle"}, {"start": 14, "end": 17, "surface": "理不尽", "kind": "word", "entries": [1550120], "form": "理不尽", "reading": "りふじん", "form_reading": "りふじん"}, {"start": 17, "end": 20, "surface": "すぎる", "kind": "word", "entries": [1195970], "form": "すぎる", "reading": "すぎる", "form_reading": "すぎる"}], "label": {"status": "adjudicated", "spec": "0.5"}}
